 "module": "m42241",
 "chapter": "16",
 "title": "振动中的周期与频率",
 "short": "周期与频率",
 "lead": "当你拨动<span data-ref=\"string\">一根吉他弦</span>时，每一次振动所用的<span data-type=\"time\">时间</span>都与前一次相同。这个<span data-concept=\"time\">时间</span>就是<span data-concept=\"period\">周期</span>，而每秒内的振动次数就是<span data-concept=\"frequency\">频率</span>。",
 "objectives": [
  "观察吉他弦的振动。",
  "确定振动的频率。"
 ],
 "summary_html": "<ul><li>周期运动是重复性的振动。</li><li>一次振动所用的<span data-concept=\"time\">时间</span>是<span data-concept=\"period\">周期</span> $\\kT$。</li><li>单位<span data-concept=\"time\">时间</span>内的振动次数是<span data-concept=\"frequency\">频率</span> $\\kf$。</li><li>这些量之间的关系为 $\\kf = \\frac{1}{\\kT}.$</li></ul>",
 "notes": "",
